# Base URL of apps/api's deployed dev environment (Render.com free-tier web
# service `training-plan-api-dev`). Baked into the static build at
# `vite build` time — same convention as .env.example, a public URL, not a
# secret.
#
# Render assigns a web service the URL https://<service-name>.onrender.com
# the moment the service is created (deterministic from the name in
# render.yaml, assuming that subdomain isn't already taken globally on
# Render — unverified until the service actually exists; see
# docs/architecture.md and the PR description for current status).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://training-plan-api-dev.onrender.com
